abstract: >-
  Exact rational certificates for blue percolation in dimension 22 and
  simultaneous blue percolation with finite spin-glass susceptibility in
  dimension 180, with independent local checks accompanying Towards the
  spin-glass transition in finite dimensions via blue percolation.
